			"notes": "## 1.0.1 2026-05-26\n\n### Added\n* **Expanded Language Support:** Added 11 new languages, including Arabic, Chinese, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Spanish, Swedish, and Ukrainian.\n* **Visuals:** Added correct item textures for all boats with beds.\n\n### Fixed & Improved\n* **Mobile Bed Mechanics:** \n  * Beds on boats now correctly set your spawn point.\n  * Spawn coordinates now update in real-time while the boat is moving, creating a truly mobile spawn point."
